## 🏛️ Sơ đồ kiến trúc hệ thống (Architecture)
*(Hình ảnh sơ đồ kiến trúc lưu tại thư mục `docs/architecture.png`)*

```mermaid
graph TD
    Client["Client (Web Browser)"]
    
    subgraph AWS_Cloud ["AWS Cloud (EC2 Instance)"]
        Firewall["Firewall / Security Group (UFW)<br>Ports: 22, 80, 443"]
        Proxy["Reverse Proxy / Web Server<br>(Nginx)"]
        
        subgraph App_Server ["Application Runtime"]
            PM2["Process Manager (PM2)"]
            NodeApp["Web/API Application<br>(Node.js / Express - Port 3000)"]
        end
        
        subgraph Storage ["Database & Storage"]
            MongoDB[("Database (MongoDB Local)<br>notedb")]
        end
    end

    Client -->|HTTP / HTTPS (Port 80/443)| Firewall
    Firewall --> Proxy
    Proxy -->|Forward Request| NodeApp
    PM2 -.->|Manages| NodeApp
    NodeApp -->|Read / Write Notes| MongoDB
